AFFIDAVIT

I, Mr. Hari Singh, S/o Shri Gopal Singh, aged 45 years,
residing at 8, Goverdhan Vilas, Udaipur – 313 001,
Horticulture Expert,
do hereby solemnly affirm and state as follows:

1. I am a qualified Horticulture Expert with 20 years of experience in landscaping projects
   and have been engaged as a consultant by M/s. Green Landscape Developers Pvt. Ltd. for the
   Integrated Township Landscaping Project.

2. I have personally inspected the landscaping site on multiple occasions and have
   reviewed all plantation records, quality compliance, and survival reports.

3. Regarding the scope creep: The additional 65 acres includes significant landscaping
   elements: 15 acres lakefront development, 30 acres green belt, and 20 acres community park.
   This is a substantial increase from the original 185 acres scope.

4. The rate analysis prepared by my office shows that the fair compensation for the
   additional 65 acres work is ₹2.84 Crore.

5. Regarding the water shortage: Per Horticulture Guidelines of India, adequate irrigation
   is critical for plantation survival during the first 6 months after planting.

6. USCL failed to provide irrigation infrastructure within 3 months of site handover as
   per contract Clause 16. This is a critical failure.

7. The survival rate of 65% (vs 95% target) is directly attributable to water shortage.
   Per industry standards, survival rate below 80% indicates inadequate irrigation.

8. The cost of ₹94 Lakh for replacement of 15,000 dead plants is reasonable based on:
   - Plant nursery costs (₹40/plant × 15,000 = ₹6 Lakh)
   - Replanting labor (₹30/plant × 15,000 = ₹4.5 Lakh)
   - Soil preparation and fertilizers (₹3.5 Lakh)
   - Extended maintenance period (₹1 Lakh)

9. Regarding quality of work: I have personally inspected all landscaping work executed.
   The quality is fully compliant with:
   - Horticulture Guidelines of India
   - Rajasthan Urban Development Specifications
   - NBC 2016 landscaping standards

10. All facts stated above are within my professional knowledge and are true to the best of my
    information and belief. No part of it is false and nothing material has been concealed.

Deponent: Hari Singh
Date: 01.10.2025
Place: Udaipur

